# Windows / Google Drive folder-metadata junk. Drive stamps desktop.ini into folders
# across this Drive-synced repo; ignoring them keeps `git status` clean and stops a stray
# `git add -A` from staging them. NOTE: this does NOT stop Drive writing desktop.ini into
# .git internals (git never applies .gitignore inside .git) — that can still break refs.
# See CLAUDE.md "Deployment" for the cleanup one-liner and the move-off-Drive plan.
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db

